{"seq":2,"slug":"amoeba-management","title":"阿米巴经营","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/amoeba-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-amoeba-system","title":"阿米巴经营模式","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/amoeba-management/the-amoeba-system","wordCount":1531,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"management-by-all","title":"全员经营的理念","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/amoeba-management/management-by-all","wordCount":1323,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 阿米巴经营\n\n本章呈现稻盛和夫独创的阿米巴经营模式。阿米巴经营，将庞大的企业划分为众多独立核算的小单元，以单位时间核算为核心，实现了全员参与经营。这一独特的管理模式，既强化了经营的效率，又激发了员工的活力。两篇文档，分别呈现阿米巴经营的模式，以及全员经营的理念。\n"}